NDIP-3 A2 open-obligation admission bound
Date: 2026-10-01
Base commit: 290323f2

Implementation:
  GenerationRuntimeIndex rejects attemptObligations.size() > admissionsUsed.
  DelayShard.applyPublishAdmission adds/replaces one obligation and increments admissionsUsed once;
  outcome resolution retains or removes obligations. This bounds the valid count by the configured
  maxPublishAdmissions or pinned RetryPolicySemantic.maxPublishAdmissions. AttemptObligationRef has
  a 158-byte canonical maximum: three 32-byte fields (34 bytes each), a 46-byte inflight key (48 bytes),
  a maximum five-byte uint32 generation (6 bytes), and a one-byte enum (2 bytes). Decode rejects
  larger inputs before protobuf field parsing.

